	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The primary model integrated structured EHR variables with quantitative pathology features extracted from digitized H&E-stained EMB slides. Data were split 80:20 by patient identifier, with 10-fold cross-validation during training and performance assessed exclusively on the held-out test set. Cross-sectional, longitudinal, clinical-only, morphology-only, and integrated configurations were compared. SHAP rankings were used to identify influential features and derive the Integrated Rejection Risk Index; no explicit hyperparameter-search or tuning procedure was reported.

